that the processor has them. Those fourteen programs are compiled into this binary. They live in
data/standard-fonts/, their provenance is data/standard-fonts/PROVENANCE.md, and the verbatim
licence texts are data/standard-fonts/LICENSE_FOXIT and data/standard-fonts/LICENSE_LIBERATION.

