5. The Unicode case-folding data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`data/unicode/CaseFolding.txt` is the Unicode Character Database's case-folding file, version
17.0.0, shipped unchanged; `crates/pdf-model/build.rs` compiles its status C and F rows into a
static table and nothing is parsed at run time. ISO 32000-2 §12.3.5.2 compares two names in one
folder of a portable collection "following case normalization" and sends a reader to Unicode
Standard Annex #21 for what that is; this file is that annex's data.
`data/unicode/PROVENANCE.md` records where it came from, its hash, and which of its four statuses
are used.

